title: Ollama /api/generate drops top-level images
updated: 2026-09-25T17:44:05Z
---

Found during k33: Protocol::Ollama parse_chat_request turns /api/generate prompt into one user message but ignores the request-level images array, so a vision request via /api/generate loses its images silently (also on passthrough-less routed models). Fix: attach data->{images} to that user message before Langertha::Knarr::Image::ollama_messages. Test in t/84_image_translation.t.
